{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 28, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler to Japan's fair shore\nA journey grand a sight to adore\nFrom ancient temples to cities bright\nWe'll weave a tale of day and night.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo**\n\nUpon the plane thy spirit doth soar\nTo Narita's gates a welcoming roar\nThy luggage claimed thy weary feet\nInto the city's pulse you're to meet.\nShinjuku's heights a wondrous view\nBright neon signs a vibrant hue\nA ramen feast a savory treat\nThen rest thy head a slumber sweet.\n\n**Day Two: Tokyo's Wonders**\n\nTo Asakusa's shrine let us then glide\nWhere ancient spirits gently reside\nSenso-ji temple a sight to behold\nStories of old in silver and gold.\nUeno Park a tranquil space\nMuseums grand a cultured grace\nHarajuku's streets a fashion spree\nYouthful trends for all to see.\n\n**Day Three: Hakone's Beauty**\n\nA journey forth to Hakone's land\nWhere mountains rise a verdant strand\nLake Ashi's surface mirror bright\nMount Fuji's peak a glorious sight.\nA cruise upon the waters flow\nArtistic gardens softly grow\nHot springs beckon warmth and ease\nA peaceful respite if you please.\n\n**Day Four: Kyoto's Charm**\n\nBy Shinkansen train we swiftly ride\nTo Kyoto's heart with graceful stride\nFushimi Inari's gates a vermilion dream\nThousands of torii a vibrant gleam.\nKiyomizu-dera temple's height\nPanoramic views a wondrous sight\nGion district where geishas roam\nA glimpse of old Japan a charming home.\n\n**Day Five: Kyoto's Temples**\n\nGolden Pavilion a dazzling grace\nKinkaku-ji temple a sacred space\nRyoan-ji's garden serene and still\nZen contemplation a tranquil thrill.\nNijo Castle's halls of power grand\nA shogun's legacy across the land\nArashiyama Bamboo Grove's sway\nNature's beauty brightens the day.\n\n**Day Six: Nara's Deer**\n\nTo Nara we journey with delight\nWhere friendly deer roam day and night\nTodai-ji temple a giant's might\nHousing Buddha a wondrous sight.\nKasuga Taisha lanterns glow\nA path of light a gentle flow\nAncient traditions softly keep\nWhile weary travelers softly sleep.\n\n**Day Seven: Departure**\n\nFrom Kansai Airport we bid farewell\nTo Japan's wonders a magic spell\nThy memories made shall ever stay\nUntil we meet on another day.\nA parting gift a treasured art\nA piece of Japan within thy heart.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.0021908108610659838}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -1.3947389561508317e-05}, {"token": "▁gentle", "logprob": -0.5696897506713867}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -0.008129720576107502}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.11255981028079987}, {"token": "▁Japan", "logprob": -0.9739763140678406}, {"token": "'", "logprob": -0.026546115055680275}, {"token": "s", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": "▁fair", "logprob": -0.5270154476165771}, {"token": "▁shore", "logprob": -0.20285765826702118}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.07000047713518143}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.007048621773719788}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.02330239862203598}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.044009316712617874}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.20457585155963898}, {"token": "▁sight", "logprob": -0.5415446758270264}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.0005261705373413861}, {"token": "▁adore", "logprob": -0.24733063578605652}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.08205872029066086}, {"token": "From", "logprob": -0.758115828037262}, {"token": "▁ancient", "logprob": -0.29625052213668823}, {"token": "▁temples", "logprob": -0.48951709270477295}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.00040725519647821784}, {"token": "▁cities", "logprob": -0.446743905544281}, {"token": "▁bright", "logprob": -0.008517367765307426}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.0003873551613651216}, {"token": "We", "logprob": -0.6875444054603577}, {"token": "'", "logprob": -1.2300450801849365}, {"token": "ll", "logprob": -2.145764938177308e-06}, {"token": "▁weave", "logprob": -0.05121767520904541}, {"token": "